From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:53:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Typer: soundness fixes behind flags, and a resolution
 trace

- fixsubst: keep the substitutions computed by match when it assumes
  coercions; dropping them let resolution prove unrelated equalities.
- eqrefute: refute closed equality goals between atoms that lie in
  different classes of the ground equalities in scope (with fixsubst).
- occurs: occurs check in unification (cyclic substitutions crashed).
- cyclecut (+cyclecutstack experiment): evaluate unmemoized extendees and
  given types as transactions, rolled back when a cycle is cut.
- trace: print the derivation of each completed resolution.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CH6tJP7hLkrpGFxEq7K6r
